accelerando-terminal-bold.ttf is the Accelerando Terminal Bold companion.
Each four-corner stroke is doubled in thickness around its center, then the
complete alphabet is fitted vertically back to the Regular face's 0..778 ink
bounds. Glyph IDs, character mappings, contour topology and 600-unit advances
are preserved. The Regular derivative is unchanged. The Bold face has weight
700 and uses the same family name so terminal bold styling can select it.
